00C5D4  2  68                   PLA
00C5D5  2  A8                   TAY
00C5D6  2  68                   PLA
00C5D7  2  AA                   TAX
00C5D8  2  68                   PLA
00C5D9  2  38                   SEC
00C5DA  2  60                   RTS
00C5DB  2               
